1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,570
Dante: Fun fact. Zombies can't climb
stairs.

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:09,641
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part one of ten: the stairs.

3
00:00:09,961 --> 00:00:12,890
Priya: Dante. That's a movie, not biology.

4
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:15,419
Dante: Stairs are the perfect defense.

5
00:00:15,539 --> 00:00:18,854
Priya: Stairs are one exit. With a horde
at the bottom.

6
00:00:19,174 --> 00:00:21,085
Dante: ...Okay. That's a trap.

7
00:00:21,405 --> 00:00:26,536
Rosa: Echo Station. Four floors. Zombies
at every door.

8
00:00:26,856 --> 00:00:31,077
Dante: Marcus. Take the stairs. I'll...
supervise.

9
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:32,337
Marcus: Why is it always me?

10
00:00:32,657 --> 00:00:34,296
Marcus: They're climbing! They're
climbing!

11
00:00:34,416 --> 00:00:35,716
Dante: ...Huh. That's new.

12
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:38,946
Teddy: Gary says zombies have legs. Legs
do stairs.

13
00:00:39,266 --> 00:00:43,240
Priya: Real rule. If it can walk, it can
climb. Always have two exits.

14
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:46,365
Steve: Excuse me. Where are the stairs?

15
00:00:46,485 --> 00:00:47,907
Rosa: No stairs, Steve.

16
00:00:48,227 --> 00:00:49,935
Marcus: I climbed four floors for a movie.

17
00:00:50,255 --> 00:00:51,885
June: You climbed beautifully, dear.

18
00:00:52,205 --> 00:00:57,350
BUS-E: Safe Zone twelve, nine stops. Route
twelve is not on any map. Cozy!

19
00:00:57,670 --> 00:01:04,098
BUS-E: Part one of ten, the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Next: the mall. Follow for part two.

